# predictions.func

> Module: predictions (Tahmin Motoru) | Category: ANALYTICS

## Purpose
Financial forecasting engine for logistics companies. Generates 12-month revenue, expense, and profit projections based on historical data, seasonal patterns, and trend analysis.

## Problems It Solves
- Small fleet owners operate without financial planning tools
- Seasonal variation in logistics (more trips in summer, less in winter)
- Cash flow forecasting for business decisions (hire driver, buy truck, expand)
- Early warning: if trend shows declining profits, take action
- Bank loan applications require financial projections

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `predictions`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| ay | INTEGER | Month number (1-12) |
| yil | INTEGER | Year |
| tahmini_gelir | DECIMAL(12,2) | Predicted revenue |
| tahmini_gider | DECIMAL(12,2) | Predicted expenses |
| tahmini_kar | DECIMAL(12,2) | Predicted profit (gelir - gider) |
| mevsimsellik_faktoru | DECIMAL(5,4) | Seasonal factor |
| created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamp |

**Calculation method:** Uses historical trip revenue data + expense data to project 12 months forward, applying seasonal multipliers.

## User Interface
**PredictionsPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/predictions`
- 12-month bar/line chart (recharts)
- Revenue bars (green), expense bars (red), profit line (orange)
- Seasonal factor indicators
- "Yeniden Hesapla" button to recalculate from live data
- Monthly breakdown table below chart
- Current year vs next year comparison

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/predictions/12-months` | Tenant JWT | 12-month forecast |
| POST | `/api/tenant/predictions/recalculate` | Tenant JWT | Recompute from live data |

